WEBVTT

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.540
<b>Greater Edo Pool</b>

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:53.170
Okay, time for a break!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.140
Your lips must have turned purple by now.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:57.260
Get out of the water for ten minutes, you stupid kids.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.070
What? I'm fine!

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:00.270
Leave us alone, lifeguard guy!

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:02.330
Have it your way.

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:05.270
But if you don't play it safe in the pool, you'll be sorry.

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:06.880
Don't come crying to me then.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:10.540
You can't scare us!

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:12.580
Hey, let's play tag!

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:14.900
What's wrong?!

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.190
Lifeguard guy!

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.390
My friend needs help!

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.550
His lips started to turn purple,

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:21.660
but then it spread

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:25.340
until his entire body was purple!

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:26.340
You idiot!

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:27.400
I warned you!

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.520
Luckily, the purple germs

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.300
haven't spread to his glasses!

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:32.700
Find a warm blanket, some warm soup,

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:35.580
a warm household, and warm glasses at once!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.060
Come back, Ishikawa!

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:42.060
The purple germs will get us!

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.560
Now you know how scary the pool is...

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:46.940
What are you people doing?!

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:50.170
I told you to make sure none of the customers drowned in fear!

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.570
Why are you scaring them away?!

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:55.700
Hasegawa-san, the pool is a death trap.

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:57.580
These kids need to experience the pain

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.920
of getting water up your nose, the infections,

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.550
and the embarrassment of leaving dirty

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:03.080
underwear where everyone can see.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.110
Once they realize how scary the pool is,

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:07.880
they've earned the right to play in the water.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.840
They don't need to be scared of turning completely purple!

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:12.740
Seriously! I finally found a job,

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:14.030
so don't screw this up for me!

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:15.010
No funny business!

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.500
Watch over the kids as they enjoy their summer,

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.600
and make sure that they make it home safely!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.020
That's the job of a lifeguard!

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:23.600
Got it?!

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:24.980
Aye aye, sir!

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:26.980
You don't get to have fun!

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:28.960
Four Eyes!

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.670
You haven't been playing the straight man!

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:31.920
Do your job, damn it!

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.260
Don't worry.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:36.220
They're checking to see if the water is safe.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:38.430
I'll be using inception to...

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:40.790
You just want to take a nap, Idicapriot!

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.000
Hey, give me a break.

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.220
I'm sick of watching kids with

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:48.670
bodies that are as flat as Ken Watanabe.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:52.670
I'm here to see girls with some jugs.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:56.300
It's summer vacation, so it's mostly kids...

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.930
Whoa, momma. Jackpot!

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.910
Whoo! You're right! She's got jugs!

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:03.420
Giant jugs!

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:05.920
Nope...

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.760
It's just a drunk terminator.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:10.190
Oh! Gin-san!

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.130
Long time no see!

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:12.070
Huh? What?

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:14.480
You know this hot babe?

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:15.690
What a coincidence.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.560
How have you been?

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.040
Oh, he was doing fine a moment ago,

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.160
but he just died.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.950
Why are you guys here?

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:28.260
Hinowa asked me to teach Seita how to swim.

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:32.210
Anyway, I didn't know what to expect from a pool,

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:33.710
but it seems to be just like Yoshiwara.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:35.460
Men and women enjoying themselves

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.690
without any clothes on.

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:37.780
No, you're wrong!

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.470
That's not what this place is for!

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:40.790
Tsukuyo-nee!

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:43.090
I wanna go down the slide!

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.970
Wait. First, you learn how to swim.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.390
That's right.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:47.990
The slide is too dangerous for someone who can't swim,

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:49.230
so start with the kiddie pool...

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:50.910
First, you pour this over your body.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:52.480
That would be for an adult pool!

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:55.820
Next, you sit down on this stool and spread your legs.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:56.570
Hey!

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:59.200
What the hell are you teaching him?!

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.960
This isn't a Yoshiwara pool!

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:01.950
Let's go then.

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:02.570
Wait!

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:08.900
We're going too fast because of the lotion!

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:11.040
Run away, everyone!

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:22.570
That was awesome, Tsukuyo-nee!

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:23.960
Again! Again!

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:25.970
One more time and that's it.

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.160
W-Wait...

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.480
Look! There's a body floating on the water!

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:34.360
Shit! Did someone get hit?!

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:36.940
There's been an accident on my watch!

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:43.290
Elizabeth! The watermelon's nice and cold now!

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.900
Let's split it open...

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:53.460
We're losing customers because of those idiots.

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:55.800
We have to keep an eye on the kids,

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.740
and any adults who might teach the kids strange games.

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:01.290
Good, I have an excuse to look around for girls with jugs.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.010
The most dangerous adult is standing right next to me, I think.

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:05.270
What?!

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:07.600
An adult in the kiddie pool teaching a kid how to swim!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.270
Adults aren't allowed in there!

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:11.020
What?! She's got big jugs?!

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:13.750
No, I'd call those tasteful cups.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.730
She's wearing a cup?

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:17.020
Oh, that's what you meant.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.530
Hey, wait a moment!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.130
The kid is...

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.850
Is she really a kid?

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:22.780
She's pretty big.

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:25.530
I think she's taller than the beanpole with cups.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.920
Kids these days get plenty to eat,

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.600
so they grow vertically.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.790
Look, it's Robert De Flato.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:34.000
Isn't that a man?

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.040
That's the body of a boy.

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:37.390
Huh?

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:38.650
It suddenly got dark.

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:39.420
Same here.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:42.930
Who were you calling Robert De Flato?

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.370
M-My mistake...

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:47.080
You must be Sylvester Stallone.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.740
Can I have an autograph?

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.600
Are you blind?!

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:01.620
I-I see...

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.490
Tasteful cups on a beanpole...

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:11.200
This is why I didn't want to come!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.990
I hate swimsuits! I hate the pool!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:13.830
Kyu-chan!

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.420
The hell are you bastards doing?!

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:18.040
Do you want me to strangle you?!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.220
You've got it wrong!

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:22.090
We were doing our job as lifeguards!

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:23.360
Zip it!

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:25.470
Your noses are bleeding, you pervs!

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:26.510
Our noses?!

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:28.800
We're bleeding everywhere, thanks to you two!

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:30.840
Anyway, this is the kiddie pool!

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:32.310
Adults aren't allowed in here!

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.000
Don't blame us!

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.660
Kyu-chan can't swim, so she was practicing here!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.970
Sorry, Kyu-chan.

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:43.420
It's my fault for forcing you to come here...

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.770
Kyu-chan looks pretty happy!

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:50.080
She's taking full advantage of the situation!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.890
Enough is enough!

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:53.540
We're turning you in to the police!

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.800
That's the quickest solution!

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:56.170
This is all a misunderstanding!

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:57.870
Otae-san!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.190
Allow me to handle this!

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:01.300
I have proof of their crime on tape!

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.550
I'll arrest them on the spot!

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:05.550
Arrest yourself!

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:06.760
Lady!

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:09.610
I have filmed the evildoings of that cop!

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.050
The stalker is finished!

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.430
Our plan is a success!

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:14.560
I was never part of any plan!

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:16.340
I did it, Gin-san!

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:18.440
I finally got a shot of your willy peeking out!

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.190
You have nothing to do with what's going on here!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.990
Blood! Blood's coming from the other pool!

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.750
The customers are running away again!

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:27.700
Wait!

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:30.320
Hey! There's also someone bleeding over there!

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:32.200
Hey! Hold on!

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:33.860
I don't believe this!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.790
Somebody's died on my watch!

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.860
Got it!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.060
Elizabeth, start the fire!

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:44.220
We'll feast like kings tonight!

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:48.700
That's such a blast!

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:49.880
I know!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:52.050
Tsukuyo-nee! Again! Just one more time!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:09:00.310
Only the idiots are left now.

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.610
This is the busiest time of the year.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.690
Look at it this way, Hasegawa-san.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.880
An accident was bound to happen

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.830
with these idiots around.

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.810
You should be glad that those kids are gone.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.620
Fortunately, these guys can take a beating,

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.370
so we can just leave them alone.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:21.070
Let's get some rest today.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:24.340
I see. You're right.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:29.220
If Jump can go on summer vacation, why can't we?!

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:30.120
That's right!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.220
The only people who watch this show

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:33.580
are the ones who don't feel like watching the news!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.350
Nobody will notice if we take a week off!

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:36.750
Damn!

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:39.220
You've got me all fired up now!

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.250
Can I take off my clothes?!

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:42.180
Can I do the butterfly butt naked?!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.100
Can I make a pool of strawberry milk?!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.070
Can I drown in a pool of strawberry milk?!

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:47.440
Doesn't matter! Doesn't matter!

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.530
Cause today, this place...

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:52.740
...is our paradise!

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:00.500
Hey.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.750
Didn't you hear me talking to you, kiddo?

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:08.510
Let me borrow some swimming trunks.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.540
Th-That's...

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:15.860
Man, my buddy suddenly got the urge to swim.

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:19.020
A cabaret club would be better, damn it.

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.590
So, we don't have our swimsuits since

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.100
this came out of nowhere.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:26.610
A pool like this should have plenty to rent.

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:29.900
If not, you've got three seconds to take off your trunks!

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:31.150
One!

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:33.910
Katakuriko, no violence.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:35.910
There's no need to worry.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:37.910
Th-That's...

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:41.120
Don't tell me that's...!

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:49.590
Shoguns have traditionally gone swimming in tighty whities.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.550
The...  The...

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.050
Shogun?!

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:58.100
<b>What Happens Twice Can Happen Thrice</b>

00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:00.560
<b>Greater Edo Pool</b>

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:01.530
Come on, are you sure?

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:02.820
Everyone will be able to see through

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:04.250
those tighty whities once they're wet.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.920
We'll have an Abarenbo Shogun

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.820
on the loose before it's Saturday night.

00:11:07.820 --> 00:11:09.550
It cannot be avoided.

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:12.320
Shoguns have traditionally been lonely down there.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.780
I-Is that really the problem here?

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:18.070
I've always been interested in swimming in a pool.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:21.080
This is an excellent opportunity for me to experience

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.200
the life of a common citizen.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.280
Man, you've got weird interests.

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:29.960
I'll be waiting at the usual cabaret club.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.650
Hey, boys.

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:34.090
Teach him how to have fun at the pool.

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:36.590
Just so you know, we snuck out.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:39.720
Don't let anyone find out that he's the shogun.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:42.000
Oh, if anything happens to him,

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.540
our heads will be rolling around the ground.

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.730
Keep that in mind.

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:48.360
W-Wait a moment!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:49.970
Call me Sho-chan.

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:50.860
Let's enjoy ourselves.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:55.190
I-I was all ready to enjoy having the pool to myself!

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:57.180
Why did the shogun have to show up now?!

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:59.740
Why does the shogun always show up at the worst possible time?!

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.740
<b>Disinfection</b>

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.740
Why is he only washing himself down there?!

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:04.170
This isn't funny.

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:07.420
We aren't dealing with a normal pool here!

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:09.060
The idiots of Edo are all

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.240
on vacation here at the same time...

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:14.260
This is the Bermuda Triangle of Idiots!

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.260
They seem to be enjoying themselves.

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.390
I would like to join them.

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:22.350
Sending the shogun out there

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.130
would be like throwing a

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:27.940
naked MatsuKen with maracas to the sharks!

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:30.020
Wh-What do we do, Gin-san?!

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:32.270
It's too late to worry about it now.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.440
We'll have to keep those idiots in line,

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:37.150
while entertaining the shogun until he leaves!

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:40.470
Give the shogun a cap and goggles

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:42.790
so they don't recognize him!

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.120
Uh, excuse me, everyone?

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:46.320
What's up?

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.460
Do you want to join us?

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:50.290
Uh, well...

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.670
There's this Sho-chan person...

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:56.670
He wants to join in the fun.

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:59.080
We don't mind at all.

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:02.610
Alrighty then. Let's welcome him aboard, Otae-san.

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:03.690
I think it's cute.

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:06.640
Some kids don't know how to make friends.

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:08.640
Come on down, Sho-chan!

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:10.280
I already consider you a friend!

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:12.710
But you aren't allowed to talk to the Lady!

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.570
Yeah, you people shouldn't be talking.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.230
It's fine with us,

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:20.870
but isn't he in his underwear instead of a swimsuit?

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:21.980
Good point.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.620
Isn't that against the rules?

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:25.450
He's making me uncomfortable.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.560
There isn't much of a difference

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:28.290
between underwear and a swimsuit.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.680
10th and 14th shouldn't be so stingy!

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:32.140
Are you people ever going to get over that?

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:33.390
They're different!

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:36.930
Underwear is dirty because you wear it for a long time!

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.260
No, it's okay.

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:39.420
His underwear is clean

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.050
since he comes from a pretty high-class background.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.810
